corr('P001023','The sum of the two spectral halves',r'zeta(A)=zeta+(A)+zeta−(A)',r'For functions of s use zeta_|A|; at zero state the phase and regularity conventions.','The manuscript denotes zero values; extending the identity to the cut zeta function at arbitrary s adds an unjustified phase omission.','ambiguity')
